record(s,t,r,d,inv,'The page gives a scalar identity for ψ_Σ, asks for its image and asks whether all CM structures on K give a faithful family. The proof compares a structure with one embedding replaced by its complex conjugate. Check 151.N1: writing A=∏_{j≠i}σ_j(x), the two products are Aσ_i(x) and A barσ_i(x); their quotient is σ_i(x)/barσ_i(x). This verifies the local quotient step on units. The subsequent written quantifier is “∀ x”, although the preceding construction varies i, and the written conclusion is x=V′_{K_r}; both are retained literally. The norm equation describes the fibre of the norm at 1; the page’s equals sign between x and V′_{K_r} is recorded without replacement. No separate proof of the final arbitrary-algebra assertion was undertaken. The final cancelled sentence is unfinished. Archive number 150.',doubts=[['151','circled paragraph marker',r'\unsure{\textcircled{b}}','Interior crossed and crowded','low'],['151','label of S_K^0→G_m',r'\unsure{\varepsilon_K}','Upper letter overwritten; lower K clear','medium']],notation=[['Prose equality abbreviation','$=$ for même','151','Two short horizontal strokes after au.'],['Written index slip','$\\forall x$','151','Crossed x retained in argument varying i.']],hand=['The = abbreviation for même is unmistakably two strokes here; C expanded it as même and H lost the clause.','A heavily retraced word can remain live: ss-groupe has no separate replacement tore.','The open-bottom ∀ has a long leftward starting stroke; both C and H expanded its later occurrence to tt.'],abbreviations=[['trivialt','trivialement'],['=','même'],['isom','isomorphisme']],events=[['151.N1','targeted proof check','Set A=∏_{j≠i}σ_j(x). The displayed products are Aσ_i(x), Abarσ_i(x), and their quotient is σ_i(x)/barσ_i(x) on units.']],extra='Certainty-only: cancelled d, i_K, ramener and On are resolved. The final cancelled ∩Ker(σ_i,barσ_i)=K_r est stable par is readable in crop scan 151 (681,2032,1430,2136); the cancellation crosses the lower letter strokes but leaves the pair and stable visible. No closing bracket is added to this unfinished clause.')
